WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.790
Here. This is Master Claude's hair.

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:03.980
Appreciate it.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:08.490
Demon King.
It's indeed Demon King's hair.

00:00:08.869 --> 00:00:11.060
Demon King! Demon King!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.660
Demon King! It's the Demon King!

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.500
There's a hint of Demon King's scent.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.329
Don't worry.
Master Claude and I...

00:00:20.329 --> 00:00:23.460
It's too late to change anything now.

00:00:23.949 --> 00:00:27.719
You... Can you be more gentle
with the Demon King?

00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:30.719
The priority is to maintain the marriage.

00:00:30.719 --> 00:00:34.380
Love can be cultivated
when things are done.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:37.039
Anyway, he'll be mine
as long as he falls in love with me.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:39.229
From a different perspective,

00:00:39.229 --> 00:00:42.259
love like this is like standing on a cliff.

00:00:42.259 --> 00:00:43.270
That's right!

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:46.030
It's to convince him to jump...

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:47.780
...or even push him down...

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.030
...so he'll never get up again!

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:19.640
I'M THE VILLAINESS,
SO I'M TAMING THE FINAL BOSS

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.500
Master Claude is going out
on an inspection?

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:24.750
THE VILLAINESS' LOVE IS UNREQUITED
That's right.

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:29.500
Demon King losing his memory and magic
is no longer a secret.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.900
That is why he is going for an inspection.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.460
The objective is to make a good impression
on the people.

00:02:35.159 --> 00:02:38.259
Master Cedric and Miss Lilia will go along too.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.180
They're going too?

00:02:40.181 --> 00:02:41.789
That's right.

00:02:41.789 --> 00:02:45.650
It was Miss Lilia
who arranged the inspection this time.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.789
If it's Miss Lilia's arrangement...

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:52.189
This is the game's world.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.569
Then, she could have
possibly started the game.

00:02:57.909 --> 00:02:58.969
Elephas.

00:02:58.969 --> 00:03:03.830
If you'd recover Master Claude's memories,
what would you do?

00:03:04.409 --> 00:03:10.250
Well... Show him things
that could help him remember the past.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.210
He didn't remember me after seeing me.

00:03:13.669 --> 00:03:15.620
It made me feel hurt.

00:03:16.319 --> 00:03:19.009
If I may be so bold to speak,
I believe this is to be expected.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:22.400
As the owner of the Holy Sword, Lady Aileen,

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.930
your affinity with
Master Claude's memory is poor.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.150
Is it because of the "holy" nature
of the Holy Sword?

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:34.900
Yes. I believe Master Claude's memory
is perhaps related to magic.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:40.319
Encountering demons should rouse his magic
and make them a better stimulus.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:45.039
Indeed. Master Claude has a deep connection
with the demons.

00:03:45.039 --> 00:03:50.789
Speaking of demons, there are reports
of demons sightings on the streets.

00:03:50.789 --> 00:03:54.409
They're risking themselves coming out
of the jungle to look for Master Claude.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:59.680
Which also means,
this inspection is related to the demons.

00:04:01.819 --> 00:04:02.889
By the way,

00:04:03.439 --> 00:04:06.139
this is from Doni.
He says it's a blueprint.

00:04:06.139 --> 00:04:07.889
Thank you.

00:04:07.889 --> 00:04:10.650
Isaac, what are you making?

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:13.370
Well, this and that, just in case.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.149
What plans do you have next?

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:19.829
I'll infiltrate Master Claude's inspection.

00:04:20.899 --> 00:04:22.579
Which is why Master Claude,

00:04:22.579 --> 00:04:26.410
please keep it a secret
if you see me during the inspection next week.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.449
I... refuse.

00:04:28.449 --> 00:04:31.920
I was about to say, what are you up to
bursting in from the terrace?

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.170
It's been three days.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.449
What are you doing?

00:04:36.449 --> 00:04:38.670
Things a fiancee would do.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.329
I'm going to break off the engagement.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:46.310
Before you break it off, I will make it
so your body can't live without me.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:05:00.000
Master Claude,
I brought you apple pie.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.160
I don't need it.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:03.870
What are you reading?

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:05.920
It has nothing to do with you.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.610
This is fun.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.620
I don't think it's fun at all.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:18.120
This is the first time
I'm having unrequited love. It feels amazing.

00:05:19.379 --> 00:05:22.550
Master Claude. Are you awake?

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:27.509
Stay there and don't come out.

00:05:30.779 --> 00:05:33.439
Master Claude. How are you feeling?

00:05:33.829 --> 00:05:37.000
What brought both of you here?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.819
We are here to tell you about the changes
to the inspection's schedule.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.939
I made some cookies.

00:05:43.939 --> 00:05:45.319
Please have them.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.500
That basket... Is there a snack in there?

00:05:52.199 --> 00:05:53.870
That's...

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.879
I had the maids prepare them.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:01.120
If only you had told me earlier.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:03.379
What am I going to do with the cookies?

00:06:03.899 --> 00:06:06.389
Since you prepared them, let me enjoy them.

00:06:07.139 --> 00:06:09.170
Can you also make some tea?

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:10.329
No problem!

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.649
He didn't want my apple pie just now!

00:06:16.089 --> 00:06:18.480
Regarding the inspection,

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.899
there have been a lot of demons
sighted in the imperial capital.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:23.649
Demons?

00:06:24.129 --> 00:06:28.509
Don't worry. We will have
the Holy Knights' apprentices coming along.

00:06:28.509 --> 00:06:31.449
Even if demons were to come out,
they'd be just small fries.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:37.610
I'll be trying out the
dress for the inspection.

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:39.470
It's almost time for me to go.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:41.129
Don't you have to go with her, Cedric?

00:06:41.129 --> 00:06:43.420
No. I'll rest a bit more.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:48.300
Oh, Master Claude.
You haven't had any of the cookies, right?

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.199
Please, at least have one bite.

00:06:51.199 --> 00:06:53.370
Here.

00:06:55.579 --> 00:06:57.730
Lilia, Cedric is here too.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.399
Don't make him misunderstand.

00:07:00.399 --> 00:07:04.870
But, I'll call you
brother-in-law one day, anyway.

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.410
So, Cedric won't be mad.

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:08.529
Right?

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:12.000
Lilia, my brother is a modest man.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.290
Don't trouble him.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.329
All right.

00:07:16.329 --> 00:07:19.170
Well, then. Master Claude.
I'll be visiting you again soon.

00:07:19.699 --> 00:07:24.750
She's still the same as always, huh...
Trying to court another's fiancee...!

00:07:26.819 --> 00:07:28.240
Brother. I feel so sorry...

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.550
...that Lilia said such things.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.620
What?!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:38.930
It's fine.
Since Cedric has already noticed anyway.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.310
Is that so?

00:07:40.959 --> 00:07:43.689
I just thought the basket looked familiar.

00:07:48.589 --> 00:07:50.639
As expected of Miss Lilia.

00:07:50.639 --> 00:07:53.079
The cookies are good, Master Claude.

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.079
Is that so?

00:07:57.709 --> 00:07:59.250
I'm going back now.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.410
What? Why are you giving it to me?

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.199
Wastes will always go to the waste bins.

00:08:04.199 --> 00:08:08.620
Waste... Wait, are you
calling me a waste bin?!

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:13.410
Master Claude.
Next time, I will bring better cookies.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:15.350
You don't have to!

00:08:17.329 --> 00:08:19.189
See you during the inspection.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.529
Wait. Are you serious about coming...

00:08:30.779 --> 00:08:32.620
Did you learn anything?

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.039
I learned how it hurts in unrequited love.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.620
Forgive me for being presumptuous,

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.309
but Master Claude should see
the look on your face now.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.330
Men are weak to women's tears.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.620
Never. I don't intend
to win him over with tears.

00:08:50.529 --> 00:08:52.720
Aileen! It's bad!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.470
Fight! A fight!

00:08:57.679 --> 00:08:59.230
I want you to return it to me.

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:02.330
I can't. This is Demon Snuff.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:05.159
You're annoying. Give it back to me.

00:09:05.159 --> 00:09:07.490
Why are you always in the imperial castle?

00:09:07.909 --> 00:09:10.000
It was agreed that you
would not leave Mirchetta!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.200
That's why Master Claude let you go!

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:15.250
It's none of your business!
This has nothing to do with you!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.450
- Of course it does! Don't break your promise!
- Have they been like this?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.789
- Auguste was patrolling...
- You're annoying! Give it back!

00:09:20.789 --> 00:09:24.500
- ...and saw her by chance so he brought her here.
- I said never!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.250
Are you done?!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.759
Know your place!

00:09:28.169 --> 00:09:29.789
It has been a while, Selena.

00:09:30.929 --> 00:09:33.039
Aileen Lauren d'Autriche.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:36.509
You're the last person I want to meet!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:40.090
Are you here at the
capital to see Master Cedric?

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:46.480
You must be here in search of support, right?

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:50.090
First of all, it must be Miss Lilia who was
once related to you that you're coming for.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:55.029
Next, it must be her fiance, Master Cedric.

00:09:56.139 --> 00:10:00.620
Master Cedric has the ability
to protect the status of women and their future.

00:10:01.409 --> 00:10:05.309
You're good at your plots,
becoming a mistress is also possible.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.730
You sound like you know me.

00:10:10.149 --> 00:10:12.169
You're indeed the ex-fiancee.

00:10:13.679 --> 00:10:16.539
Mistress... It can't be!

00:10:17.259 --> 00:10:21.659
I plan to have someone rich marry me
arbitrarily after graduation, anyway.

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:27.309
I just want to marry someone rich and in power!
What is wrong with that?!

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:33.740
It's true. It's worth a shot.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:36.159
Thanks for your understanding.

00:10:36.159 --> 00:10:38.700
Can you let me go now?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:42.080
Auguste. Return everything to her,
except the Demon Snuff.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:42.950
But...

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:50.350
Selena. If you have any intelligence
you wish to provide, send me a message.

00:10:51.659 --> 00:10:55.509
I can give you what you want.

00:10:58.139 --> 00:10:59.850
I'll walk you out.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.539
Whatever.

00:11:10.659 --> 00:11:12.610
Auguste. Is this going to be all right?

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.299
I don't know.

00:11:15.899 --> 00:11:19.360
She'll get married right after graduation...

00:11:20.009 --> 00:11:21.940
Everyone has their own story.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.250
If you care about everything,
there won't be an end to it.

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:28.100
Actually, I think she is being silly.

00:11:28.909 --> 00:11:31.750
She's always playing nice in school
in front of others.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.759
But, I guess she is trying very hard too.

00:11:35.139 --> 00:11:39.759
Since you know that, you should face her.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:43.730
Yes. You're right.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.309
I'll go look for her!

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:53.649
You used to respect Miss Lilia so much
but you're trying to court her husband now.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:57.370
It's because this is about my life.
It's only natural to do that.

00:11:58.789 --> 00:12:02.379
Initially, I wanted to ask
the Holy Sword Maiden for help.

00:12:02.379 --> 00:12:03.539
But...

00:12:04.529 --> 00:12:06.500
Is that woman trouble?

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:10.750
No. It's just bothering me.

00:12:15.409 --> 00:12:18.450
I couldn't tell
what that woman was up to.

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:23.450
Wouldn't it be dangerous
to try to get her fiance then?

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:28.509
I have nothing else to lose anymore.

00:12:30.049 --> 00:12:31.019
Selena!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.159
Let me send you back.

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:37.899
I have to apologise to you...

00:12:38.769 --> 00:12:41.039
Even though I can't forgive you
for what you did to James.

00:12:41.039 --> 00:12:43.159
If you can't forgive me, why are you here?

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:47.120
Are you trying to show that you're kind?

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:49.750
No...

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:53.500
Don't come after me anymore!
I'm disgusted by you.

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:00.830
ELEPHAS LEVI
VA: KOKI UCHIYAMA

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:01.750
THE LAST DESCENDANT OF
LEVI, THE MAGIC GRAND DUKES

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:02.750
THE LEVI TRIBE
IS SEEN AS A TRIBE WITH DANGEROUS MAGIC

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:03.539
THE KINGDOM HELD HOSTAGES OF THE YOUNG
AND OLD AND COERCED THEM INTO BECOMING

00:13:03.539 --> 00:13:04.970
THE MAGE THAT PROTECTS THE ROYAL FAMILY ELMIR
WHO ARE ACTIVE IN THE DARK

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:09.980
These apprentices
are going to escort Your Highness's carriage.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:12.059
Raise your heads, all of you.

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:20.610
This is Aili Kahlua.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.570
He'll take command of the entire unit.

00:13:22.909 --> 00:13:26.200
Take command...
Don't tell me, is she the captain?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.580
No... I mean he...

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:29.750
Yes.

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:34.850
He's strong and
can bring down the Holy Knights alone.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:37.379
Alone?

00:13:37.379 --> 00:13:40.340
It's said that he'll have a bright future.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.840
Bright future...

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.659
Aili Kahlua.
Escort Your Highness to the carriage.

00:13:45.659 --> 00:13:47.870
The rest of you, get ready for departure.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:48.870
Yes!

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.409
Your Highness. This way, please.

00:13:55.809 --> 00:13:58.690
What are you doing?

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.769
You'll be executed if you meet me.

00:14:00.769 --> 00:14:05.450
As long as Master Claude
and I have an engagement,

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:07.330
I won't be executed.

00:14:08.159 --> 00:14:09.860
Are you threatening me?

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.889
Go back, now.

00:14:11.889 --> 00:14:14.080
I don't want to be involved with you anymore!

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.899
Brother. It's pointless for you to say that.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.470
That's just how she is.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:24.000
Hurry up and return to your post.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.250
Do you want me to unmask you?

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:28.500
Oh, try me.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:31.750
This time,
I will plunge you into the depths of hell.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:33.409
What are you saying?

00:14:33.409 --> 00:14:37.370
You must have hidden Selena
in a safe place, right?

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:39.730
Selena? What are you talking about?

00:14:40.169 --> 00:14:42.700
You can pretend all you want.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:44.990
I'm just blabbering.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:47.580
Blabbering to a talking waste bin.

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:51.159
You... What do you think I am?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.000
You two have a good relationship.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:57.419
It must be weird for me to be here.

00:14:57.419 --> 00:14:58.590
I'm leaving.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:01.019
But, Master Claude!

00:15:03.159 --> 00:15:05.139
Don't come near me.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:09.759
You're still the same as always.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.460
Naturally, Brother would feel uncomfortable.

00:15:16.289 --> 00:15:19.019
Master Claude feels uncomfortable?

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:23.580
Miss Aileen, the carriage is about to leave.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:27.659
All right. How is the plan?

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.990
Yes. It's just as planned.

00:15:31.539 --> 00:15:35.039
Besides, I found the person
in charge of this inspection too.

00:15:35.429 --> 00:15:38.919
Person in charge? Isn't it Master Cedric?

00:15:39.539 --> 00:15:42.259
It's a high government official
named Leister Craine.

00:15:42.259 --> 00:15:45.299
He appears to have planned
the routes as well.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.850
Leister...

00:15:47.909 --> 00:15:51.220
I remember he is a character
that can be tamed from the first game.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.419
A calm and levelheaded strategist.

00:15:54.409 --> 00:15:57.750
Which also means,
Miss Lilia who is also familiar with the game...

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.690
...has tamed him.

00:16:07.039 --> 00:16:11.409
It seems I have to stay away
from Aileen Lauren Dautriche.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:14.340
She is related to my past.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.659
Master Claude.
Sorry for making you wait.

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:21.250
Where is Cedric?

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.610
He's not feeling well.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.590
He plans to rest in the castle today.

00:16:27.269 --> 00:16:29.970
Is it fine that you're not with him?

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:33.720
And being alone with a man
who is not your fiance...

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.659
It's all right.

00:16:35.659 --> 00:16:39.480
Master Claude and I
are going to be family one day.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:59.750
Do you feel bored being with me?

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:03.950
No. I just think that I'm unreliable.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.130
Why are you saying that?

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.650
You just have to stay the way you are...

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:13.140
...because you're an important person.

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:22.900
What?

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.788
I've never heard
that a carriage could be lifted like that...

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:32.319
Lilia!

00:17:32.869 --> 00:17:35.789
You demon!
Return Master Claude!

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:39.329
Return! You! No way!

00:17:39.329 --> 00:17:41.079
Save the Demon King!

00:17:41.079 --> 00:17:42.079
Protect the Demon King!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.250
Is he talking about me?

00:17:45.539 --> 00:17:48.869
Almond. Lure this one to the plaza.

00:17:48.869 --> 00:17:50.369
We'll catch him there.

00:17:50.369 --> 00:17:51.250
Got it.

00:17:52.579 --> 00:17:54.849
Unit One, follow me.

00:17:54.849 --> 00:17:57.250
Fenrir Unit, chase the humans away.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:03.670
Holy Sword.

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:12.720
Where's Master Claude?

00:18:15.819 --> 00:18:16.789
Miss Aileen.

00:18:25.309 --> 00:18:27.920
- Protect His Highness.
- Yes!

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:29.630
Do not shoot him!

00:18:30.009 --> 00:18:30.630
Fire!

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.690
They are saved!

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:52.069
Hold your fire.

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:55.410
Everyone, take the demon away!

00:18:59.869 --> 00:19:02.289
It seems like we don't need the sedatives.

00:19:02.289 --> 00:19:04.130
It's larger than imagined.

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:10.190
Next, let's take them to the castle.

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:15.450
Yes. Protecting him under the Holy Knight's name
can protect his reputation.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.839
Very clever.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:20.130
This is a small matter.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:23.230
Put them down.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.779
How troublesome.

00:19:39.369 --> 00:19:41.200
Demon King!

00:19:43.579 --> 00:19:45.819
Save. Demon King.

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:48.880
No.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.420
Don't hurt the humans! Retreat!

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:57.799
But... the Demon King's wishes...

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.430
What are you talking about?

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:05.410
It seems like I should stay away
from Aileen Lauren d'Autriche.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.190
You!

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:12.099
You're in the Demon King's way! Be gone!

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:17.420
The hearts of the demon
and Demon King are connected.

00:20:18.039 --> 00:20:19.950
So, this means...

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:22.950
I don't need you!
Be gone!

00:20:23.579 --> 00:20:26.829
I'm... the woman who is not needed?

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:29.460
Be gone!

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.210
Aili. What are you doing?

00:20:31.539 --> 00:20:32.789
Walt! Lyle!

00:20:32.789 --> 00:20:34.369
Kill it!

00:20:34.369 --> 00:20:35.710
No way!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.970
Master Claude would be very sad...

00:20:54.579 --> 00:20:55.450
What a fool.

00:20:56.079 --> 00:20:59.309
Treating the Demon King's
intention as an order.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:05.359
Demon King.
We will do as you wish.

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:08.609
If the Demon King doesn't need us,

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.880
we will disappear before you.

00:21:22.579 --> 00:21:29.710
Master Claude is so obsessed with me
that you'd have the demons dispose of me.

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:31.970
- I... I didn't...
- Smile.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.420
Just as you always do.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:40.829
I know this is only my unrequited love.

00:21:40.829 --> 00:21:42.240
I have misunderstood.

00:21:42.789 --> 00:21:43.750
But...

00:21:55.589 --> 00:21:58.710
If I've causing you trouble, I will leave!

00:21:59.539 --> 00:22:02.079
I will not go to the ball too!
